{"availability":"available","full":"NavSirohi/NavxShopperVoice","name":"NavxShopperVoice","description":"🛍️ NavxShopperVoice — Talk to your shopping cart like a real shopkeeper. Built with React 18, TypeScript, TailwindCSS, Web Speech API & Firebase.","category":"Design","language":"TypeScript","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-08-24T16:14:19Z","updated":"2026-08-24T16:14:43Z","branch":"main","homepage":null,"topics":[],"demo":"https://voiceshopnavx.web.app/","color":"#63362a","ink":"#f8c7a8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-04T08:18:08.210Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-04T08:18:08.210Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-04T08:18:08.210Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-04T08:18:08.210Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":["React"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Have you ever tried online grocery or e-commerce shopping and wished you could just talk to the app like a real neighborhood shopkeeper?","Instead of tapping around menus, applying endless filters, or guessing package sizes, VoiceShop lets you shop completely hands-free using natural human conversation. Whether you speak English, Hindi, or casual Hinglish (\"cart me 200g tomato daal do\"), VoiceShop understands your intention, adjusts quantities dynamically, and calculates exact prices on the fly!"],"features":["SEARCHPRODUCTS: Look up items across groceries, electronics, fashion, medicines, and daily essentials.","ADDTOCART: Seamlessly add items directly to your shopping bag.","REMOVEFROMCART: Delete specific items from your bag by voice.","FILTERPRODUCTS & CLEARFILTERS: Filter by brand, price under budget, star ratings, or reset filters instantly.","SHOWCART / HIDECART / CLEARCART: Open, close, or empty your cart hands-free."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/NavSirohi/NavxShopperVoice/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"eaf43181be049b1116abb1a6cddc909632f3c5b0b0b0b5e2c6785337590a8b49","extractedAt":"2026-10-04T08:18:08.348Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-04T08:18:08.348Z","projectInsights":{"version":1